# Vercel deploy input filter for the frontend-hosted app.
# Data shape: gitignore-style patterns relative to the repo root.
# Syntax: blank lines group deployment concerns; # starts comments.
# Important behavior: root Python backend manifests are ignored so Vercel does
# not run `uv pip install` for the Heroku/FastAPI backend during frontend deploys.
# Possible bug: if the backend is intentionally moved to Vercel later, remove
# the Python-manifest ignores and add a dedicated Vercel Functions contract.
# Extensions: split frontend/backend Vercel projects, or add a root vercel.json
# that documents the frontend root directory explicitly.

.env*
.DS_Store
*.log
coverage/
.cache/
.pytest_tmp/
__pycache__/
venv/
.venv*/
nflenv/
tmp_pytest/
tmp_pytest_run/
tmp_history_status_check/

backend/
data/
requirements.txt
pyproject.toml
.python-version
Procfile
.buildpacks
.slugignore
.heroku/

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/.venv*/

*.joblib
*.pkl
*.md
*.ts
*.csv
*.png
*.jpg
*.ipynb

dist/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vercel/
frontend/.env*
